sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as KServe Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar (pod-local)
    participant REST as MLServer REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as MLServer gRPC<br/>8081/TCP gRPC/HTTP2
    participant DP as DataPlane Handler
    participant Runtime as Runtime Plugin<br/>(sklearn/ONNX/XGBoost/LightGBM)
    participant Models as Model Storage<br/>/mnt/models (PVC)
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP HTTP
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client, Runtime: Flow 1: REST Inference Request
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>RBAC: Forward (pod-local)
    RBAC->>REST: HTTP 8080/TCP<br/>No encryption (pod-local)
    REST->>DP: Python call (in-process)
    DP->>Runtime: model.predict()<br/>Python call (in-process)
    Runtime->>Models: Load model artifacts<br/>(filesystem read)
    Models-->>Runtime: Model weights/artifacts
    Runtime-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>REST: InferenceResponse
    REST-->>RBAC: JSON Response
    RBAC-->>Gateway: Forward
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client, Runtime: Flow 2: gRPC Inference Request
    Client->>Gateway: gRPC ModelInfer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>RBAC: Forward (pod-local)
    RBAC->>GRPC: gRPC 8081/TCP<br/>No encryption (pod-local)
    GRPC->>DP: Python call (in-process)
    DP->>Runtime: model.predict()<br/>Python call (in-process)
    Runtime-->>DP: InferenceResponse
    DP-->>GRPC: ModelInferResponse
    GRPC-->>RBAC: gRPC Response
    RBAC-->>Gateway: Forward
    Gateway-->>Client: gRPC Response<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Prom, Metrics: Flow 3: Prometheus Metrics Scrape
    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8082/TCP
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus text format<br/>(counters, histograms)
